{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06415","headline":"送刘方平 · 李颀","name":"送刘方平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮纨游上国，多作少年行。\n二十二词赋，惟君着美名。\n童颜且白皙，佩德如瑶琼。\n荀氏风流盛，胡家公子清。\n有才不偶谁之过，肯即藏锋事高卧。\n洛阳草色犹自春，游子东归喜拜亲。\n漳水桥头值鸣鴈，朝歌县北少行人。\n别离斗酒心相许，落日青郊半微雨。\n请君骑马望西陵，爲我殷勤吊魏武。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}